# globalThis[name]("12")
# The key names none of the members of the global object. What may be `eval`, `Function` or `Worker` is none of them: the call is a call of something nobody knows and no event.
# The run time refuses an evaluator in an image whose build saw no application of one. read-of-the-global-object-by-name-hands-out-the-evaluator.ir names one
# RUN: valueflow-solve unseen
# CHECK-NOT: unseen EvaluatesText
# CHECK-NOT: unseen LoadsModuleByName
# CHECK: unseen-code no
# CHECK-NEXT: modules-by-name no

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" body=f0
entry module=m0
function f0 name="main" kind=Module results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0():
    v0 = Builtin builtin=DateNow
    v1 = Call v0
    v2 = ToString v1
    v3 = Builtin builtin=GlobalThis
    v4 = ElemGet v3, v2
    v5 = String string="12"
    v6 = Call v4, -, v5
    Return
}
